    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nsango kūlwa Misili nguno ya Baisilaeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mhayo ūyū gūkiza kūlī Yelemia kūlwa Bayudaya bose pye abo bikalaga Misili; mapandī ga Megidoli, Tahapanesi, Memfisi na Patilosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ū SEEBA wa mabità, ū Mulungu wa Isilaeli, alīhaya gīkī, ‘A bing'we ng'wagilolelekeja na miso ging'we ūmo gaalī ū būtaale a mayanga ayo nakagūgwisīja ū nzengo gwa Yelusalemu, nī mizengo ya Yuda pyī ī yose. Kūshisha lelo īyī ī mizengo yenīyo īlī dalali hangī makambagūkīle gike, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kūlwa būbi ūbo baawīta a bikaji baamo, abo baalī banipelanya kūlwa kūnikoloosha nguno ya kūbazuukīja būbbani bamulungu bangī na kūbalamya; bamulungu abo baalī batabamanile a boi nūūlū a bing'we, nūūlū a bakūlūgenji bing'we.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naabatūma no a batūmami bane a bahangi, abo bikalaga būbawīla gwa gwa gwa gīkī, ‘Bing'we lekagi ū kwīta ū mhayo gw'ipelanya gwenūyū natagūtogilwe!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo batanidegelekile nūūlū kūnidīlīla yaya; batalekanile nī mihayo yabo ī ya malofu, nū kūbazuukīja būbbani bamulungu bangī batoyile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "H'ī nguno yene ū būkalī wa būpelanu bone būkabaka, wihoolekela ū mu mizengo ya Yuda, nū mu mapanda ga Yelusalemu; kūshisha ī mizengo yenīyo yūkenaagūka, na yūbiza dalali gīt'ūmo īlī ī lelo īyī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū, ū SEEBA wa mabità, ū Mulungu wa Isilaeli, alīhaya gīkī, Nibūlī mulīhaya kwiyenheleja mayanga mataale gīko, ga kūmalwa banhū ba Yuda; bagosha na bakīma na banīgīnī, na beleele hose, mutizūlekeelelwa būshiigo bose bose? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nibūlī mulīnipelanya na kūnikoloosha kūlwa milīmo ya makono ging'we, na kūbazuukīja būbbani bamulungu bangī ū mu sī ya Misili, ūmo ng'wizile kwikala? Mugwikenaagūla bing'we benekelīlī ng'wiyīte kūbiza shikolo sh'izumo n'ibengwe ū mu mahanga gose ga mu sī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulīwība ū būbi ūbo baawīta bakūlūgenji bing'we, nū wa batemi ba Yuda na bake babo; nū būbo ng'wawīta a bing'we benekīlī na a bake bing'we ū mu sī ya Yuda nū mu mapanda ga mu nzengo gwa Yelusalemu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bataalī kwidoohya kūshisha lelo, nūūlū ni koolecha logohano dūhū yaya; nūūlū ī shilagīlo shane batūshilondeelaga, pye na a malange ayo naagatūūla kūlwa nguno ying'we na bakūlūgenji bing'we.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Hūna lūūlū, ū SEEBA wa mabità, ū Mulungu wa Isilaeli, alīhaya gīkī, Ī haha nizunīlīgije gwa kūng'wenhela mayanga, na kwīkenaagūla pye gete ī Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakūwīnja ū būshiigo wa banhū ba Yuda abo baalī bagaabīlile kwiza Misili kwikala mo. Pye a benabo bakūchīla Misili, bakūcha mu būlūgū nūūlū bo nzala. Bakūbiza shikolo sh'izumo n'igekemaja, banhū ba kūyilembekejiwa mihayo na kwibengelejiwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo balī Misili nakūbinha nsango mu nzīla ya līlūshū, nzala na mahūūya; gīt'ūmo nakīyītīla ī Yelusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu banhū ba Yuda abo basaagīīla hūna būja kwikala Misili, atilonga wa kūpūlūgūka nūūlū ūmò, nūūlū wa kūpīla gīkī alashoke kū sī ya Yuda, īyo balī na ng'hūmbū ja kūshoka kwikala ko; atilonga wa kūshoka ko, ūlū ītī babūngi bagehu dūhū.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna pye a bagosha abo baalī badeebile gīkī a bake babo bakabazuukījaga būbbani bamulungu bangī, na a bakīma pye abo baalīho hoi; ibità itaale no, na a banhū a bangī pye abo bikalaga Patilosi, Būnshokeja ū Yelemia būhaya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“A bise tūtūkūzunīlīja ū mhayo ūyo ūlītūwīla mu lina lya ng'wa SEEBA gwenūyū! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo tūkūgūshikīlīja būlī mhayo ūyo twagūhayile gīkī tūkūgwīta; ū Ngole wa Ng'wigūlū",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44:17",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ng'wigūlū:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Walī mulungu wabo nkīma.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " tūkūnzukīja dūhū ū būbbani, nī shitambò sha kūng'wiwa tūkūshiita kūlwa ngungo yakwe gīt'ūmo twītīlaga na kale ū mu mizengo ya Yuda nū mu mapanda ga Yelusalemu; a bise benekīlī, na a bakūlūgenji bise na a batemi bise, pye na a batongeeji bise. Ū mu shikū jenījo twapandīkaga ī shilīwa sha kūtwigela; twalī mhola no, shalī shitīho sha kūtūkoya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo aho tooya dūhū ū kūnzuukīja būbbani ū Ngole wa Ng'wigūlū, nū kwita ī shitambò sha kūng'wiwa kūlwa nguno yakwe tooya, kwīngīīla henaho tooya ū kūpandīka ī shikolo, hama twandya kūyikala tūkūbūlagagwa būlūgū na mayala.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bakīma bongeja kūhaya gīkī, “Ī gīsī ng'hana, aho twanzuukījaga būbbani ū Ngole wa Ng'wigūlū, na kwita shitambò sha kūng'wiwa kūlwa nguno yakwe, a bagoshi bise baalī batamanile ī gīkī twabeejaga na migatī mu suso yakwe, nī shitambò sha kūng'wiwa twita kūlwa nguno yakwe?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna a banhū benabo pye a bose, bagosha na bakīma, aho banshokeja gīko ū Yelemia, akashosha ūbawīla: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ī gīsī, ū SEEBA atīyizūkilwe na kwīyiganika ī mihayo ya būbbani ūbo bozukījiagwa na bakūlūgenji bing'we, hamò na batemi na batongeeji bing'we, na a banhū a bangī ū mu mizengo ya Yuda, nū mu mapanda ga Yelusalemu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angū ū SEEBA akanoga ū kwiyūmīlīja nasho ī shītīle sha malofu shenīsho, nī mihayo ying'we y'ipelanya; h'ī chene ī sī ying'we īkagalūka yūbiza shikolo shizumile, n'itogolo lītī na solobo, īlo banhū batadūgije kwikala mo, gīt'ūmo īlī nī lelo īyī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū būkenaagūji wenūbū būmupandīka gīt'ūmò mulībonela gīkī, kūlwa kūzuukīja būbbani na kūng'wītīla shibi ū SEEBA; nguno mulemile ū kūng'wigwa nū kūshilondeela ī shilagīlo shakwe na a malange gakwe, pyī nī yīyo amuhelelile.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
