          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yelemia ūbawīla hangī pye a banhū, baalīmo na bakīma; ūhaya, “Bing'we banhū bose ba Yuda abo mulī kūūnū Misili, gwigwagi ū mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA wa mabità, ū Mulungu wa Isilaeli, alīhaya gīkī, ‘A bing'we na a bake bing'we ī haha ng'wīshikīlījaga ū mu shītīle shing'we, īyo ng'walahīla kwīyīta;’ aho mukahaya, ‘Ū Ngole wa Ng'wigūlū tūkūnshikīlīgīja dūhū a bise ūmo twalahīlīlile; ū būbbani tūkūnzuukīja, nī shitambò sha kūng'wiwa tūkwita kūlwa nguno yakwe.’ Alilūūlū, gwītagi ū mhayo gwing'we, gūshikīlījagi ūyo mugūhayile! Shidimagi ī shilahīlo shing'we! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike lūūlū bing'we Bayudaya bose pye abo muzengile Misili, gwigwaagi ū mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA, Ū SEEBA alīhaya gīkī, ‘Nalīlahīla mu lina lyane itaale, būlī ng'wene ūyo wafuma Būyudaya wiza kwikalaga hose hose mu sī ya Misili,’ atīko kūlītūmamīla hangī ī lina lyane akūhayaga, ‘Ūmo Seeba MULUNGU alī mpanga!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno nalī miso kūlwa kūbenhela mayanga, ītī yawiza; a Bayudaya abo balī mu Misili bakūbūlagwa bo līlūshū na nzala, kūshisha bashile pye gete. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakūbiza bagehu no a bakūbūpūlūgūka ū būlūgū bīnga ī Misili būshoka Yuda. Hūna ū mu gīko py'ū būshiigo wa banhū ba Yuda abo bakiza kwikala Misili, bakūgūdeeba ū mhayo ūyo gūlī na nguzu, ū gwane nūūlū ū gwabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
